#HELPS

0 ORACLE PRAY ASK SEER~

The Oracle is an ancient seer who answers questions about Times of Chaos.

  pray             go to her sanctum (one seeker at a time)
  say <anything>   in her sanctum, everything you say is said to her
  ask <question>   the same, as a command
  say done         return to where you prayed (or step down the beads)
  say wrong        tell the gods her last answer was wrong

She knows commands, classes, races, remorts, skills, areas, leveling, and
what gear to seek for your class and level, and she has read the game's
own help.  She can see where an item or creature is right now, what a
player or a creature is wearing, and where an item drops -- but only as
far as you could see for yourself: never the gods, never anyone stealthed
or hidden from you, and never what is in someone's pack.  She remembers
what you asked earlier in the same audience, so you may follow up.  She
answers only questions about the game and keeps it brief.

An audience lasts at most five minutes and ends sooner if you fall silent.
However it ends, you return to where you prayed, dazed for a moment.  You
cannot pray in battle, while your blood is still up, while something hunts
you, or from a death trap.  The gods may bar a troublemaker from her.
~

60 FARSLAY ORACLEADMIN~

Immortal tools for the Oracle and the Farslay rite.

  farslay <player>      a god's Farslayer: 100%, never backfires, reaches
                        anywhere.  Works on anyone except the divinely
                        warded, who turn the blade back on the caster.
  oracle                the Oracle's status and recent transcript
  oracle dismiss        send the Oracle home now
  oracle ban <player>   bar a player from praying to the Oracle
  oracle allow <player> lift that bar

The Oracle and Herbie cannot be fatalitied; the warded cannot be slain and
turn Farslay back on any caster.
~

